config COCO_IMAGE_SHARE
	tristate "CoCo image share driver"
	depends on ARM64
	help
	  Provides a small ioctl interface for the Image CVM and Runtime CVM
	  to exercise the RMM image-share object prototype. The Image CVM can
	  register a file as non-contiguous source pages and seal it as a share
	  object; the Runtime CVM can attach/detach read-only windows.

	  This is a bring-up driver for the windowed block-device path.
